{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_14103250","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14103250","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410324001:":{"text":"因度厄卫队长听令——","source_cn":"因度厄卫队长听令——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66670CB9E57DC85E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410324002:":{"text":"铲除那些外来者","source_cn":"铲除那些外来者","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A81684AC6E330AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410325001:1":{"text":"冕下，这些外来者曾协助我们处理孽化……他们并无恶意。","source_cn":"冕下，这些外来者曾协助我们处理孽化……他们并无恶意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7D4C9E0F0554B43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410325002:1":{"text":"冒充我们的盟友，这本身就是大罪。","source_cn":"冒充我们的盟友，这本身就是大罪。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x079F29C040DBDE25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410325003:1":{"text":"因度厄，你一向最为忠诚，应该了解什么是对萨洛克兰最好的选择。","source_cn":"因度厄，你一向最为忠诚，应该了解什么是对萨洛克兰最好的选择。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EC450EDBF5C7951","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410325004:1":{"text":"但冕下，他们似乎只想离开此处。无论冒充与否，都不会影响两族合作——","source_cn":"但冕下，他们似乎只想离开此处。无论冒充与否，都不会影响...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A3C307DE3EA9429","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410325005:1":{"text":"够了。忠诚，就不该容忍任何危险的存在。","source_cn":"够了。忠诚，就不该容忍任何危险的存在。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0263A34823EA69C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410325006:1":{"text":"他们已经知道了太多。无论是孽化、恩典灵露还是我们和矮人的合作……","source_cn":"他们已经知道了太多。无论是孽化、恩典灵露还是我们和矮人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF798C95410AC249D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410325007:1":{"text":"如果我们能够——","source_cn":"如果我们能够——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x397FE8A536BF59F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410325008:1":{"text":"想想女王，想想萨洛克兰的子民们，你要为了几个外来者违背女王的意志吗？","source_cn":"想想女王，想想萨洛克兰的子民们，你要为了几个外来者违背...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9D03C8E61F55525","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1410325009:0":{"text":"遵命……冕下。","source_cn":"遵命……冕下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63DCD82